※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4674
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4674 LANG_GENERATOR_DEFER_THROUGH_CALLS

※ A walk through calls may stop part way, and what a generator put off with
※ `defer` would then never run.

@[impure]
fn guarded(n: u8) ⇉ u8:
    defer bump()
    yield n

@[impure]
fn bump():
    pass_through()

@[impure]
fn pass_through():
    return

fn sum(s: ⇉u8) → u8:
    0u8

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    let b := sum(guarded(1u8))
    0u6
